# SHA-256 of the eight data-independent OOXML parts of the REAL old Tradenet 2.0 DCCA
# export (TradenetAdmin/uploads/AccountSummary.xlsx on origin/master, 2 Sep 2021, 543 rows).
# The embedded skeleton must reproduce these exactly; DccaWorkbookWriter copies them through
# untouched, so every generated DCCA file carries the same bytes.
#
# Regenerating the skeleton from the AUTHORING TEMPLATE instead of the export would change
# five of these. DccaWorkbookSkeleton.Validate() also checks semantic markers, because
# whoever makes that mistake would update this file in the same commit.
